			"notes": "**The mod formerly known as EndReborn is reborn again — now *The Void-Weaver's Awakening*.**\n\nA complete overhaul of the **End dimension** for **Minecraft 26.2 (Fabric)**, beyond the dragon fight.\n\n### ✨ This release\n- **Full rebrand** to *The Void-Weaver's Awakening* — new id/namespace `voidweaver`, new package, new display name.\n- **New boss: The Prismarch** — a crystalline rune-armoured colossus with **four floating orbiting hands**. A ranged, three-phase fight: homing crystal-bolt volleys, radiant novas, and summoned Crystal Sentinels. 260 HP.\n\n### 🌌 What's inside\n- **6 alien End biomes** (Shattered Barrens, Void Gardens, Obsidian Wastes, Crystal Highlands, Endless Abyss, Chorus Jungle) with custom flora, sky & fog.\n- **3 bosses** — Chorus Guardian, The Voidbringer, and now **The Prismarch** — plus ~10 mobs.\n- **Materials & blocks** — Chorus Wood set, three stone families, Chorus Alloy & Void Crystal gear.\n- **Data-driven structures** — palaces, spires, ruins and temples that house the bosses.\n- **80+ custom sound effects** across mobs, blocks, and ambience.\n\n### ⚙️ Install\nRequires **Fabric Loader ≥ 0.19.3**, **Fabric API**, **Java ≥ 25**, **Minecraft 26.2**. Drop the jar in your `mods/` folder.\n\n> ⚠️ **Breaking:** worlds created under the old `endreborn:` id will not migrate — start a fresh world. Bosses are now `voidweaver:prismarch`, `voidweaver:chorus_guardian`, `voidweaver:voidbringer`.\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/SquareDealSam/EndReborn/compare/v0.1.0...v2.0"
		},
